            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 14,
            "SpeakerName": "外国人男性",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "失礼了……我无论如何都想和你谈一谈。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190120",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119016,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 15,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "哪家的星探吗。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190130",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
                    "HeadDirectionMasterId": 1,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 24,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 20103,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119017,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 16,
            "SpeakerName": "星探",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "我从美国来。/n希望能邀请你加入我们。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190140",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119018,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 17,
            "SpeakerName": "星探",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "如今美国正在积极招揽人才。/n为了组建一个不输给欧洲和中国的新型大型剧团。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190150",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119019,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 18,
            "SpeakerName": "星探",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "我们国家，正需要像你这样新时代的天才。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190160",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119020,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 19,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "新时代的天才吗……被这样称呼，感觉倒也不坏。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190170",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 71,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 20103,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119021,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 20,
            "SpeakerName": "星探",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "如果你愿意加入，我们会支付巨额报酬。/n退役后的职位也可以保证。条件不差吧？",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190180",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119022,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 21,
            "SpeakerName": "星探",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "对你来说，Eden这样的小剧团只会成为束缚。/n能让你那份巨大才能彻底发挥出来的地方，才是适合你的舞台。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190190",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119023,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 22,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "哦……那么，那个所谓的大型剧团，/n可以完全任我调遣吧？",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190200",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 109,
                    "HeadDirectionMasterId": 1,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 20103,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119024,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 23,
            "SpeakerName": "星探",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "什么……？",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190210",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119025,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 24,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "在剧团里，我的话就是绝对。/n允许这一点，是我接受挖角的最低条件。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190220",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
                    "HeadDirectionMasterId": 1,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 20103,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119026,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 25,
            "SpeakerName": "星探",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……别说蠢话了。由区区一个演员支配一切的剧团？/n怎么可能有那种地方。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190230",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119027,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 26,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "有啊。就是这个Eden。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190240",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 109,
                    "HeadDirectionMasterId": 1,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 20103,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119028,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 27,
            "SpeakerName": "星探",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "什……！？",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190250",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119029,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 28,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "我对连Eden都比不上的剧团没兴趣。/n好了，请回吧。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190260",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 109,
                    "HeadDirectionMasterId": 1,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 20103,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119030,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 29,
            "SpeakerName": "星探",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……总有一天你会后悔的。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190270",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119031,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 30,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "我对“总有一天”那么遥远的未来没兴趣。/n我脑子里已经全是明天的公演了。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190280",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
                    "HeadDirectionMasterId": 1,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 24,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 20103,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119032,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 31,
            "SpeakerName": "星探",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "没想到你竟然傲慢任性到这种程度……。/n像你这样的演员，我们也敬谢不敏。告辞。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190290",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1020119033,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1020119,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 32,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……失算了。反正都要赶走他，/n早知道就该先让他再多夸我几句。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10201190300",
            "CharacterMotions": [
